  "biography": {
    "plain_text": "Charlie Munger was an American billionaire investor and Berkshire Hathaway vice chairman, closely associated with Warren Buffett. Born in Omaha, he trained at Harvard Law School and practised law in California. Apartment developments produced his first substantial fortune; long-term investing subsequently made him wealthy. He died in 2023, aged ninety-nine.",
    "html": "<p>Charlie Munger was an American billionaire investor and Berkshire Hathaway vice chairman, closely associated with Warren Buffett. Born in Omaha, he trained at Harvard Law School and practised law in California. Apartment developments produced his first substantial fortune; long-term investing subsequently made him wealthy. He died in 2023, aged ninety-nine.</p>\r\n",
    "word_count": 50,
